00:01:40,240 --> 00:01:42,999
For the training scenario,
work in this order.

34
00:01:43,460 --> 00:01:44,059
Step 1.

35
00:01:44,620 --> 00:01:48,889
Confirm Advanced Data Protection access
and review the enrollment checklist.

36
00:01:49,300 --> 00:01:50,050
Step 2.

37
00:01:50,479 --> 00:01:54,710
Prepare administrator MFA and
department key-recovery arrangements.

38
00:01:55,139 --> 00:01:55,859
Step 3.

39
00:01:56,330 --> 00:01:59,639
Enroll through the owning screen
and review supported content,

40
00:01:59,639 --> 00:02:02,160
